WEBVTT

00:15:26.922 --> 00:15:30.092
And they will do what Afghan women
have always done.

00:15:30.926 --> 00:15:34.012
Meet uncertainty head on
and rise above it.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.226
I know they will do their part.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:41.770
But they,

00:15:41.812 --> 00:15:45.482
we need something from you,

00:15:45.524 --> 00:15:47.901
all of you here and watching this.

00:15:48.944 --> 00:15:52.489
So today I issue
another challenge to the world.

00:15:53.615 --> 00:15:55.242
Do not look away.

00:15:56.952 --> 00:15:58.870
As the noise dies down,

00:15:58.912 --> 00:16:02.165
and Afghanistan slips
from the front pages,